<Base title="Terms of use" description="The terms for using fibub's free tools.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
    <p>fibub's tools are free and provided as they are, without any warranty. Check important results yourself, and keep your original files: a tool may change a file in ways that do not suit you.</p>
    <p>Calculators give estimates for general information only. They are not financial, tax, legal or immigration advice. Rules such as tax rates or photo requirements change; confirm them with the official source before you rely on them.</p>
    <p>Use the tools only with files you have the right to use. fibub does not offer tools to remove passwords or copy protection from files.</p>
    <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Last updated 2026-11-06.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
